ELEMENT ZR HCP_A3 9.1224E+01 5.5663E+03 3.9180E+01 !

$ SGTE Unary Standard Element Reference Gibbs Free Energy Functions (Dinsdale 1991)
FUNCTION GHSERAG 298.15 -7209.512+118.202013*T-23.8463314*T*LN(T)-0.001790585*T**2; 1234.93 Y -15095.252+190.266404*T-33.472*T*LN(T); 3000.0 N !
