PARAMETER G(LAVES_C15,CR:TI;0) 298.15 +2*GHSERCR#+GHSERTI#-21000+3.4*T; 6000.0 N !
PARAMETER G(LAVES_C15,CU:MG;0) 298.15 +2*GHSERCU#+GHSERMG#-36800+5.6*T; 3000.0 N !

$ 3. LAVES_C36 (MgNi2-type Dihexagonal P6_3/mmc, hP24)
PHASE LAVES_C36 % 2 2.0 1.0 !
CONSTITUENT LAVES_C36 :NI,CO,CR,FE:MG,TI,NB: !
PARAMETER G(LAVES_C36,NI:MG;0) 298.15 +2*GHSERNI#+GHSERMG#-64200+9.0*T; 3000.0 N !
